{"id":"11c6019276c591ed","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-global-reflection.md","title":"Global Reflection","display":"df-global-reflection — Global Reflection","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-global-reflection","aliases":["92-df-global-reflection"],"display":"df-global-reflection — Global Reflection","depends_on":["[[92-df-provable]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-arithmetic-truth]]","[[92-df-g-system]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-global-reflection"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-global-reflection</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-global-reflection — Global Reflection"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"482ac6c3f68b4b5b\" href=\"?note=482ac6c3f68b4b5b\" title=\"92-df-arithmetic-truth\">92-df-arithmetic-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-global-reflection-—-Global-Reflection-$\\mathrm{Rfn}_\\mathrm{glob}(G)$\">df-global-reflection — Global Reflection <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rfn}_\\mathrm{glob}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rfn}_\\mathrm{glob}(G)\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (system G, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> (metatheoretic provability relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (sentence set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G\\)</span> (external arithmetic-truth predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"482ac6c3f68b4b5b\" href=\"?note=482ac6c3f68b4b5b\" title=\"92-df-arithmetic-truth\">92-df-arithmetic-truth</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GlobRfn}\">\\(\\mathrm{GlobRfn}\\)</span> (definition-target global-reflection predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}global\\text{-}reflection}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GlobRfn}(G)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\bigl(G\\vdash\\varphi\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(\\varphi)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}global\\text{-}reflection}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GlobRfn}(G)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\bigl(G\\vdash\\varphi\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(\\varphi)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GlobRfn}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{GlobRfn}(G)\\)</span>是元语言中的全局可靠性断言：每个<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>-可证句都在标准算术中为真</li>\n<li>它蕴含外部一致性<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span>，但不声称每个算术真句都可由<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>证明</li>\n<li>该外部断言不同于对象语言中的局部或统一反射模式，不能直接说成“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>内的一条句子”</li>\n<li>更强的元理论可证明适当弱理论的全局反射；反射的内部不可证性需要另行说明编码与强度假设</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-global-reflection-—-Global-Reflection-$\\mathrm{Rfn}_\\mathrm{glob}(G)$","text":"df-global-reflection — Global Reflection $\\mathrm{Rfn}_\\mathrm{glob}(G)$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"51c43e0240787ebb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-arithmetic-truth","status":"resolved","id":"482ac6c3f68b4b5b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-arithmetic-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G$ (system G, see [[92-df-g-system]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"51c43e0240787ebb","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\vdash$ (metatheoretic provability relation, see [[92-df-provable]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_G$ (sentence set, see [[92-df-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-arithmetic-truth","status":"resolved","id":"482ac6c3f68b4b5b","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G$ (external arithmetic-truth predicate, see [[92-df-arithmetic-truth]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rfn}_\\mathrm{glob}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GlobRfn}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}global\\text{-}reflection}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GlobRfn}(G)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\bigl(G\\vdash\\varphi\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(\\varphi)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GlobRfn}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false}],"bytes":1455,"backlinks":[{"id":"1ea2ee34667cb5dd","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"统一反射模式与外部全局反射分别见[[92-df-universal-reflection]]和[[92-df-global-reflection]]"},{"id":"d76d3a84b374975c","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GlobRfn}$ (global-reflection predicate, see [[92-df-global-reflection]])"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-54","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-global-reflection]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-54","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[92-df-analytical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetic-truth.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetical-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetical-truth.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-for